argument:: nameA
argument:: nameB
argument:: title
argument:: width
argument:: height

METHOD:: features
One vector per frame, pooled into code::points:: cells.
METHOD:: matrix
Similarity as the rank of each distance: 1 nearest, 0 farthest.
METHOD:: metricName

